 752:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp.c **** /**
 753:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp.c ****  * @ingroup tcp_raw
 754:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp.c ****  * Binds the connection to a netif and IP address.
 755:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp.c ****  * After calling this function, all packets received via this PCB
 756:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp.c ****  * are guaranteed to have come in via the specified netif, and all
 757:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp.c ****  * outgoing packets will go out via the specified netif.
 758:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp.c ****  *
