1602:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp.c **** /**
1603:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp.c ****  * Deallocates a list of TCP segments (tcp_seg structures).
1604:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp.c ****  *
